A [[{{PAGENAME}}]] is a basic piece of defensive head [[armor]], made from [[Leather]], [[String]] and [[Boar Tusk]]s.

==Quality Formula==

The quality formula is <math>\frac{_{q}Leather + _{q}Boar Tusks + _{q}String}{3}</math> [[softcap]]ped by <math>\sqrt{Sewing * Dexterity}</math>.

